### Location hierarchy tests: Regione > Provincia > Città
### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@token = {{login.response.body.data.tokens.accessToken}}
@regionId = {{createRegione.response.body.data.id}}
@provinceId = {{createProvincia.response.body.data.id}}
@cityId = {{createCitta.response.body.data.id}}

### 0) Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 1) Login as ADMIN (replace email/password)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "YourAdminPassword"
}

### 2) Create Regione
# @name createRegione
POST {{baseUrl}}/regioni
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Lombardia"
}

### 3) List Regioni (nested tree: provinces + cities)
GET {{baseUrl}}/regioni

### 4) Create Provincia under Regione
# @name createProvincia
POST {{baseUrl}}/province
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Milano",
  "regionId": "{{regionId}}"
}

### 5) List Province filtered by Regione
GET {{baseUrl}}/province?regionId={{regionId}}

### 6) Create Città under Provincia
# @name createCitta
POST {{baseUrl}}/citta
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Milano",
  "provinceId": "{{provinceId}}"
}

### 7) List Città filtered by Provincia
GET {{baseUrl}}/citta?provinceId={{provinceId}}

### 8) Get single Città (includes province + region)
GET {{baseUrl}}/citta/{{cityId}}

### 9) Create Clinic under Città (optional next step)
POST {{baseUrl}}/clinics
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Clinica Centrale",
  "cityId": "{{cityId}}"
}

### 10) Soft-delete Città (ADMIN)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/citta/{{cityId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
